  <result aggregation-status="1" type="1">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Annual Output Results</narrative>
   </title>
   <indicator ascending="0" measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output Indicator</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Endorsement of the Strategy 2040
Endorsement of the Government Programme 
The level of integration of SDG indicators into the national framework</narrative>
    </description>
    <baseline year="2018">
     <comment>
      <narrative xml:lang="EN">Launch of the Strategy 2040
Launch of the 5 year Government Programme 
National SDGs monitoring matrix is submitted to the Government</narrative>
     </comment>
    </baseline>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2022-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2022-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. SDG monitoring system is set up. 
2. Number of key stakeholders with increased capacity on SDG integration aspects, in gender sensitive ways.
3. Batken oblast development strategy is aligned with SDGs, taking into account gender aspects</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Strengthening statistical data for SDG monitoring: National Statistical Committee is introducing UN ESCAP SDG Tracker. SDG indicators target values are developed based on national strategies and programs.
2. Capacity building for SDGs: More than 50 officials and experts of the Presidential Administration and the Cabinet of Ministers discussed the institutional landscape for the SDG coordination in light of the recent structural reforms, reviewed SDGs progress and challenges through intersectoral approaches covering legal, policy-making and practical implementation of the Agenda-2030.
4. Batken oblast development strategy open parts had been analyzed from SDG angles, matrix of indicators had been aligned with SDG indicators, training for the Batken oblast administration strengthened their capacity to maintream SDGs into regional level planning processes.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2021-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2021-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Post-VNR follow-up work is progressing in inclusive, transparent and gender-sensitive manner.
UNDP has provided targeted support to localization of SDG with strong focus on innovations and gender-responsive actions.
